title: Which skgrepo the herald names
pid: 4bb478dc-f9bc-4bfa-8725-c6794b389248
body: |2-
  The herald shows the current name of the loaded skgrepo whose remote
  has the recorded hash, so renaming that skgrepo in a config renames
  the herald too. Where no remote was recorded, it shows the recorded
  name if a skgrepo of that name, with no remote either, is loaded.
  Otherwise it shows the recorded name followed by =?=:
  =⌂:<jeff-decid/claude-public?>= says no loaded skgrepo is known to
  be the one recorded.
